      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pain in children from the neonate to the teenager has recently begun to achieve the attention it deserves in the medical literature. Practitioners have been slow to apply both old and new techniques in this patient population. This review focuses on the perioperative management of pain and its associated symptoms in pediatric patients."},
